  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We estimate that the net proceeds to us from this offering will be approximately $\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003million after deducting\nunderwriting discounts and estimated offering expenses. We will not receive any of the proceeds from the sale of shares by the selling stockholder, although we will bear the costs, other than the underwriting discounts and commissions, associated\nwith those sales. We intend to use the net proceeds that we receive from this offering, together with cash on hand and the net proceeds\nfrom the other Financing Transactions, to fund the Acquisition, effect the 2028 Notes Redemption and pay related fees and expenses. See \u201cSummary\u2014The Transactions\u2014Illustrative Sources and Uses.\u201d The closing of this offering is not contingent on the closing of the Acquisition or the other Financing Transactions. The shares offered\nhereby will remain outstanding whether or not the Acquisitio",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors Investing in our common stock involves significant risks. See \u201cRisk\u00a0Factors\u201d beginning on page S-21 of this prospectus supplement, as well as on page 3 of the accompanying prospectus and\nin the documents incorporated by reference herein, for a discussion of factors you should consider carefully before deciding to invest in our common stock. The number of shares of our common stock outstanding after this offering is based on 100,530,599\u00a0shares outstanding as of\nOctober\u00a030, 2026, and does not include: (i)\u00a07,703,942\u00a0shares of our common stock reserved for future issuance under our Third Amended and Restated CVR Energy, Inc. 2007 Long Term Incentive Plan (the \u201cCVI LTIP\u201d); (ii)\nshares of our common stock that may be issued upon settlement of outstanding equity awards under the CVI LTIP, including the performance share units granted on June\u00a022, 2026, subject to the terms of the ap",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
